#: extension/prefs.js:76
msgid "General"
msgstr "Allgemein"

#: extension/prefs.js:78
msgid ""
"Windows get the corners, outline and shadow of libadwaita windows. "
"libadwaita apps draw them themselves and are left as they are."
msgstr ""
"Fenster bekommen die Ecken, die Randlinie und den Schatten von libadwaita-"
"Fenstern. libadwaita-Apps zeichnen sie selbst und bleiben unverändert."

#: extension/prefs.js:82
msgid "Focus border"
msgstr "Fokus-Rahmen"

#: extension/prefs.js:83
msgid ""
"Marks the focused window with a border in the accent color of the system. It "
"lies inside the window edge in place of the outline. Off by default."
msgstr ""
"Markiert das aktive Fenster mit einem Rahmen in der Akzentfarbe des Systems. "
"Er liegt innen an der Fensterkante anstelle der Randlinie. Standardmäßig aus."

#: extension/prefs.js:84
msgid "Width"
msgstr "Breite"

#: extension/prefs.js:85
msgid "In pixels. Default:"
msgstr "In Pixeln. Standard:"
